;Historical recipe
* Prior to the [[Game updates/2021-07-13|July 13, 2021]] ([[Legendary Armory]] release), the following recipe was used to upgrade the [[Slumbering Transcendence]] into '''Transcendence'''.
* With the introduction of the [[Legendary Armory]], the legendary amulet [[Slumbering Transcendence]] is no longer obtainable, but previously crafted amulets can be still upgraded into Transcendence by using the historical recipe.
{{Recipe
| source = Mystic Forge
| quantity = 1
| ingredient1 = 1 Slumbering Transcendence
| ingredient2 = 250 Unidentified Dye
| ingredient3 = 1 Emblem of Tournament Victory
| ingredient4 = 1 Essence of Llamatic Elegance
<!-- | status = historical Can be used still. -->
}}

