== Notes ==
* Transcendence was announced in a blog post on March 12th 2020.<ref>[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/looking-ahead-to-spring-summer-and-the-future/ Looking Ahead to Spring, Summer, and the Future], GuildWars2.com</ref>
* It was released alongside the [[Visions of the Past: Steel and Fire]] update on [[Game updates/2020-03-17|March 17, 2020]].
* Following the release of the [[Legendary Armory]] and the discontinuation of Slumbering Transcendence the visibillity of the effect associated with Transcendence can be freely toggled from within the [[Equipment]] panel.
* [[Slumbering Transcendence]] provides the same benefits as Transcendence without any visual effects.

